Z||000027||Jaygee79||09-19-2000||10:36 PM||||I usually just hold it with one hand and steer with the other.  I have an automatic though.  When I was in high school I would lay my backpack on the seat and put the cup between the bag and the back of the seat.  That worked fine until one day my coffee got a little squished and spilled all over the seat and the backpack.  Don't do that anymore.<p>[This message has been edited by Jaygee79 (edited 09-19-2000).]||||reg||6
